Package: com.legacyfixes.textnow
Name: TextNow Legacy
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: An unofficial TextNow client for legacy 32-bit iOS. Sign in with your own TextNow account, browse conversations, and send or receive SMS over TextNow's web API. Built for iOS 7 on the iPhone 4 (armv7).
Maintainer: LegacyFixes
Author: LegacyFixes
Section: Applications
Depends: firmware (>= 7.0), firmware (<< 10.0)
